# Motion

Initialize Lenis only in `SmoothScroll`. Register GSAP only through `registerGsap()` in `src/lib/gsap.ts`.

- Sync Lenis with ScrollTrigger in that one place: `lenis.on("scroll", ScrollTrigger.update)` and `gsap.ticker`.
- Do not start a second `requestAnimationFrame` loop or a second Lenis instance.
- Heading reveals use `RevealLines`. Image reveals use `RevealImage`. Do not split text ad hoc in a section.
- Official SplitText is not installed. Do not add a Club-plugin import.
- Skip smooth scroll, header hiding, the pinned program row, and reveal motion when `useReducedMotion()` is true. Text must stay visible if animation never runs.
- Program areas and Knowledge Hub use Swiper. The featured-program row is the only horizontal scroll tied to vertical scroll, and it lives in that section.
- Partner logos use `react-fast-marquee`. Do not replace that strip with a hand-rolled CSS track.
- Clean up GSAP contexts, observers, and listeners on unmount. Do not call `ScrollTrigger.getAll().forEach(kill)` from `SmoothScroll`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — new Lenis inside a section
useEffect(() => { new Lenis(); }, []);

// ✅ GOOD
<RevealLines as="h2" className="section-title">Learning you can put to work</RevealLines>
```
